$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General Procedure for the Preparation of Alkenes 5. Vinylmagnesium
bromide (1 M in THF, 1 equiv) was added at 0 °C to a solution of aldehyde
7 (1 equiv) in dry THF (0.7 M). The reaction was stirred for 2 h at 0 °C.
The mixture was then diluted with diethyl ether and quenched with a
saturated NH4-Cl solution. The organic layer was separated, washed twice
with water, dried over anhydrous sodium sulfate, filtered, and
concentrated. The residual oil was used without further purification.
product, yield 100%.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
