$DATUM (E)-1,1,1-Trifluoronon-5-en-2-yn-4-ol (1g). To a solution of LDA (66
mmol) in THF (100 mL) was added dropwise 2-bromo-3,3,3-trifuluoropropene
(3.0 mL, 30 mmol) at -80 °C. After the mixture was stirred for 5 min at
that temperature, crotonaldehyde (2.17 g, 31 mmol) in THF (3 mL) was
added, and stirring was continued for 1.5 h at -80 °C. Usual workup and
chromatography (n-hexane/AcOEt, 15:1) afforded 1g (4.61 g, 24 mmol, 80%):
colorless oil. Rf = 0.52 (n-hexane/ EtOAc, 4:1); 1H NMR 0.93 (t, J = 7.2
Hz, 3H), 1.44 (sex, J = 7.2 Hz, 2H), 1.95 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 1H), 2.08 (q, J
= 7.2 Hz, 2H), 4.94 (m, 1H), 5.60 (ddt, J = 15.3, 6.6, 1.5 Hz, 1H), 5.93
(dtd, J = 15.0, 6.6, 0.9 Hz, 1H); 13C NMR 13.6, 21.8, 34.0, 62.3 (q, J =
1.3 Hz), 72.8 (q, J = 52.0 Hz), 86.3 (q, J = 6.2 Hz), 114.1 (q, J = 256.8
Hz), 126.5 (q, J = 1.3 Hz), 136.1; 19F NMR -51.94 (s); IR (neat) 607,
632, 742, 919, 966, 1031, 1145, 1216, 1276, 1459, 1669, 2271, 2877, 2935,
2965, 3320 cm-1; HRMS (FAB) m/z calcd for C9H12F3O [M+H]+ 193.0840, found
193.0862.
