$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of (E)-2-Methyl-1-phenyl-1,5-hexadien-3-ol (1u)5 Following
the Representative Procedure, α-methyl-E-cinnamaldehyde (146 mg, 1.0
mmol), RuCl3•xH2O (6.2 mg, 0.03 mmol, 0.03 equiv), allyl acetate (163 μL,
1.5 mmol, 1.5 equiv), H2O (27 μL, 1.5 mmol, 1.5 equiv), Et3N (14 μL, 0.1
mmol, 0.1 equiv), hexamethylbenzene (16 mg, 0.1 mmol, internal standard
for NMR analysis) and dioxane (2.5 mL) were combined under 35 psi of CO
at 80 °C for 48 h. Workup and purification by silica gel column
chromatography eluting with hexanes/MTBE (5:1, 400 mL) provided 1u (148
mg, 79%) as a pale yellow oil. (E)-2-Methyl-1-phenyl-1,5-hexadien-3-ol
(1u)5, yield 148 mg, 79%. Data for 1u: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) 7.38-7.20
(m, 5 H, Aryl), 6.52 (br, 1 H, HC(1)), 5.83 (m, 1 H, HC(5)), 5.20 (d, J =
15.3, 1 H, HaC(6)), 5.17 (d, J = 8.5, 1 H, HbC(6)), 4.24 (quint, J = 5.5,
1 H, HC(3)), 2.52-2.40 (m, 2 H, H2C(4)), 1.91 (s, 3 H, H3C(7')), 1.87 (d,
J = 5.5, 1 H, HO). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) 139.5 (C(2')), 137.5 (C(1')),
134.5 (C(5)), 128.9 (C(3') & C(5')), 128.1 (C(2') & C(6')), 126.4
(C(4')), 125.7 (C(1)), 118.0 (C(6)), 76.5 (C(3)), 40.1 (C(4)), 13.6
(C(7')) IR (NaCl) 3390 (m), 3071 (m), 3018 (m), 2977 (m), 2914 (m), 1640
(m), 1599 (m), 1490 (m), 1442 (m), 1325 (m), 1041 (s), 997 (s), 916 (s).
HRMS (CI) Calcd. for C13H17O, 189.1279; found, 189.1280 TLC Rf 0.40
(hexanes/MTBE, 4:1) [UV, CAM]
