$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: (22) Typical Procedure. To a suspension of
indium powder (0.115 g, 1 mmol) in THF (1 mL) was added
1-acetoxy-3-bromo-1-propene 3 (0.175 mL, 1.5 mmol) at 0 °C. The
heterogeneous mixture was stirred for 30 min at 0 °C, the ice bath was
removed, and stirring was continued for 3.5 h at room temperature. The
aldehyde was added (1 mmol) at 0 °C, and the reaction mixture was stirred
for 4 h at 0 °C. Syn-1-Phenyl-but-3-en-1,2-diol (Syn-6a).
Syn-(1E)-1-Phenyl-hexa-1,5-dien-3,4-diol (Syn-6f).
Anti-(1E)-1-Phenyl-hexa-1,5-dien-3,4-diol (Anti-6f).
Syn-(1E)-1-Phenyl-hexa-1,5-dien-3,4-diol (Syn-6f). 1H NMR (300 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 2.18 (d, J = 3.0 Hz, 1H), 2.21 (d, J = 3.0 Hz, 1H), 4.04-4.08
(m, 1H), 4.09-4.12 (m, 1H), 5.28 (dt, J = 1.5/10.5 Hz, 1H), 5.42 (dt, J =
1.5/17.5 Hz, 1H), 5.94 (ddd, J = 5.7/10.5/17.5 Hz, 1H), 6.21 (dd, J =
6.3/15.9 Hz, 1H), 6.70 (d, J = 15.9 Hz, 1H), 7.21-7.42 (m, 5H); 13C NMR
(50 MHz, CDCl3) δ 75.6, 75.9, 117.4, 126.5, 127.9, 128.3, 132.6, 135.9,
136.5. Anti-(1E)-1-Phenyl-hexa-1,5-dien-3,4-diol (Anti-6f). 1H NMR (300
MHz, CDCl3) δ 2.07 (d, J = 3.2 Hz, 1H), 2.10 (d, J = 3.0 Hz, 1H),
4.12-4.16 (m, 1H), 4.18-4.21 (m, 1H), 5.31 (dt, J = 1.5/10.5 Hz, 1H),
5.40 (dt, J = 1.5/17.5 Hz, 1H), 5.95 (ddd, J = 6.3/10.5/17.5 Hz, 1H),
6.24 (dd, J = 6.3/15.9 Hz, 1H), 6.68 (d, J = 15.9 Hz, 1H), 7.20-7.40 (m,
5H); 13C NMR (50 MHz, CDCl3) δ 75.3, 75.7, 117.7, 126.9, 127.3, 127.5,
132.8, 135.6, 136.3.
