Jeanette A.; Bohne, Cornelia; Ault, Bruce S.; Gudmundsdottir, Anna D.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2014), 79(19), 9325-9334

