$DATUM According to the Grignard addition to aldehyde 19, aldehyde 20 (433.9 mg,
2.85 mmol) in THF (25 mL) was subjected to reaction with Ph(CH2)3MgBr
(5.00 mL, 0.80 M in THF, 4.00 mmol) at rt for 1 h to produce alcohol 21
(E)-6,10-Dimethyl-1-phenylundeca-5,9-dien-4-ol (21) Colorless oil, (723.7
mg, 93%). IR (neat) 3377, 1453, 748, 699 cm−1; 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ
1.36 (br s, 1 H), 1.42−1.54 (m, 1 H), 1.57−1.74 (m, 3 H), 1.59 (s, 3 H),
1.67 (s, 6 H), 2.01 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2 H), 2.05−2.14 (m, 2 H), 2.63 (t, J
= 7 Hz, 2 H), 4.37 (dt, J = 9, 6 Hz, 1 H), 5.07 (t, J = 7 Hz, 1 H), 5.16
(d, J = 9 Hz, 1 H), 7.14−7.20 (m, 3 H), 7.23−7.30 (m, 2 H); 13C NMR (100
MHz, CDCl3) δ 16.7 (+), 17.8 (+), 25.7 (+), 26.4 (−), 27.3 (−), 36.0 (−),
37.3 (−), 39.6 (−), 68.5 (+), 124.0 (+), 125.8 (+), 128.0 (+), 128.3 (+),
128.5 (+), 131.8 (−), 138.7 (−), 142.5 (−); HRMS (FAB) calcd for
C19H28ONa [(M + Na)+] 295.2038, found 295.2036.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
