$DATUM According to the Grignard addition to aldehyde 19, aldehyde 22 (445.5 mg,
2.93 mmol) in THF (25 mL) was subjected to reaction with Ph(CH2)3MgBr
(5.10 mL, 0.80 M in THF, 4.08 mmol) at rt for 1 h to furnish alcohol 23
(Z)-6,10-Dimethyl-1-phenylundeca-5,9-dien-4-ol (23) Colorless oil, (737.7
mg, 93%). IR (neat) 3364, 1452, 748, 699 cm−1; 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ
1.35 (br s, 1 H), 1.41−1.53 (m, 1 H), 1.55−1.77 (m, 3 H), 1.59 (s, 3 H),
1.68 (s, 3 H), 1.72 (d, J = 1 Hz, 3 H), 2.00−2.17 (m, 4 H), 2.63 (t, J =
7 Hz, 2 H), 4.33 (dt, J = 9, 6 Hz, 1 H), 5.06−5.14 (m, 1 H), 5.18 (d, J =
9 Hz, 1 H), 7.13−7.20 (m, 3 H), 7.23−7.30 (m, 2 H); 13C NMR (100 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 17.7 (+), 23.37 (+), 23.39 (+), 25.7 (+), 26.6 (−), 27.5 (−),
32.4 (−), 36.0 (−), 37.2 (−), 68.0 (+), 124.0 (+), 125.8 (+), 128.3 (+),
128.5 (+), 129.1 (+), 132.5 (−), 138.9 (−), 142.5 (−); HRMS (FAB) calcd
for C19H28ONa [(M + Na)+] 295.2038, found 295.2066.
