$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Addition of 3 to 3-phenylpropanal in THF occurred at 10 °C in 30 min;
however, the yield of 1-phenyl-5-hexen-1-ol (4) was 74% as a result of
the formation of the corresponding ketone derived by Oppenauer-type
oxidation in 7% yield and the diallylation product in 5% yield. See ref
4b. Formation of these byproducts was suppressed by addition of DMF (1.0
equiv of the gallium metal) in the reaction mixture, and 4 was obtained
in 93% yield.
