$DATUM Thompson, Christina M.; Quinn, Catherine A.; Hergenrother, Paul J.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Medicinal Chemistry (2009), 52(1), 117-125

