$DATUM Morrill, Christie; Beutner, Gregory L.; Grubbs, Robert H.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2006), 71(20), 7813-7825

