$DATUM stereoselective, dr = 67:33
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM (R)- and (S)-4-TIPS-3-butyn-2-ol. Useful Precursors of Chiral Allenylzinc
and Indium Reagents
