$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
1-((Z)-2-Phenylethynyl-1-cyclooctenyl)-3-buten-1-ol (6a); Following the
General Procedure E; General Procedure E. To a stirred solution of 11
(4.50 mmol) in Et2O (25 ml) was added allyl Grignard reagent (0.81 M
solution in Et2O, 9.00 mmol) at 0 °C and stirred for 30 min. The mixture
was then quenched by addition of saturated aq. NH4Cl, extracted with
EtOAc three times, and washed with brine. The organic layers were dried
over Na2SO4 and concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue was
purified by silica gel column chromatography to give 6.
(Z)-6-(5-Chloro-1-pentynyl)-10-methyl-1,5,9-undecatrien-4-ol (6q);
Following the General Procedure E, the reaction was carried at -78 °C and
quenched with saturated aq. NH4Cl at the same temperature; purified by
silica gel column chromatography (hexane/EtOAc = 5/1) (84% yield,
colorless oil). 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ 1.61 (s, 3H), 1.68 (d, J= 1.2 Hz, 3H),
1.81 (br s, 1H), 1.99 (quint, J= 6.4 Hz, 2H), 2.07-2.14 (m, 2H),
2.15-2.22 (m, 2H), 2.30-2.35 (m, 2H), 2.56 (t, J= 6.8 Hz, 2H), 3.66 (t,
J= 6.4 Hz, 2H), 4.61 (tt, J= 12.9, 6.6 Hz, 1H), 5.05-5.18 (m, 3H), 5.63
(d, J= 8.0 Hz, 1H), 5.82 (ddt, J= 17.4, 10.3, 7.3 Hz, 1H); 13C NMR
(CDCl3) δ 16.87, 17.68, 25.63, 26.79, 31.35, 37.41, 41.34, 43.55, 69.70,
79.07, 93.78, 117.89, 123.27, 124.87, 132.16, 134.17, 137.70; HRMS (FAB)
calcd for C17H25ClONa (M++Na) 303.1492, found 303.1481.
