$DATUM Preparation of 1-(Cyclohexen-1-yl)-3-buten-1-ol (1v)12 Following the
Representative Procedure, 1-cyclohexene-1-carboxaldehyde (110 mg, 1.0
mmol), RuCl3•xH2O (6.2 mg, 0.03 mmol, 0.03 equiv), allyl acetate (163 μL,
1.5 mmol, 1.5 equiv), H2O (27 μL, 1.5 mmol, 1.5 equiv), Et3N (14 μL, 0.1
mmol, 0.1 equiv), hexamethylbenzene (16 mg, 0.1 mmol, internal standard
for NMR analysis) and dioxane (2.5 mL) were combined under 35 psi of CO
at 80 °C for 48 h. Workup and purification by silica gel column
chromatography eluting with pentane/MTBE (10:1, 100 mL; 4:1, 200 mL); the
solvent was removed by rotary evaporation at 5-10 °C, 25 torr, provided
1v (118 mg, 78%) as a colorless oil. 1-(Cyclohexen-1-yl)-3-buten-1-ol
(1v)12, yield 118 mg, 78%. Data for 1v: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) 5.78
(ddt, J = 17.0, 10.2, 7.4, 1 H, HC(3)), 5.67 (br, 1 H, HC2')), 5.14-5.08
(m, 2 H, H2C(4)), 4.00 (m, 1 H, HC(1)), 2.36-2.25 (m, 2 H, H2C(2)),
2.10-1.88 (m, 4 H, H2C(3') & H2C(6')), 1.68-1.51 (m, 5 H, H2C(4') &
H2C(5') & HO). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) 139.2 (C(1')), 134.9 (C(3), 123.0
(C(2')), 117.6 (C(4)), 75.2 (C(1)), 39.8 (C(2)), 24.9 (C(3')), 23.8
(C(6')), 22.6 (C5')), 22.5 (C(4')). IR (NaCl) 3366 (m), 3075 (m), 2928
(s), 2853 (s), 1641 (m), 1436 (m), 1297 (m), 1137 (m), 1030 (m), 912 (s),
842 (m). HRMS (CI) Calcd. for C10H15O, 151.1123; found, 151.1120 TLC Rf
0.48 (hexanes/MTBE, 4:1) [I2, CAM]
